WrapperToken::previewUnwrap
├── when wrappedTokenAmount is zero
│   └── it should return zero
├── when pt amount rounds down to zero
│   └── it should return zero
└── when pt amount is greater than zero
    ├── it should return (wrappedTokenAmount * exchangeRate / 10 ** DECIMALS) rounded down
    ├── given exchangeRate equals 10 ** DECIMALS
    │   └── it should return wrappedTokenAmount
    ├── given exchangeRate is greater than 10 ** DECIMALS
    │   └── it should return more PT per wrapped token than one-to-one when not exact
    └── given exchangeRate is less than 10 ** DECIMALS
        └── it should return fewer PT per wrapped token than one-to-one when not exact
